    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2237460/extras/91fb569ecd5cd00d2803b54b213e1137.avif?t=1743523927\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A JuVentures Game</h2>         Nita &amp; Snek are on the run! Help our heroes to fight through endless waves of enemies in this beautifully drawn fast-paced 3-button punch action game located in the JuVentures universe.    <br>    <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2> <br>Fight against the endless waves of enemies that come from both sides.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">            <li>Punch enemies</li>            <li>Unlock new characters</li>            <li>Punch more enemies</li>            <li>Unlock new locations</li>            <li>Punch more enemies</li>            <li>Lots of dying</li>            <li>3 game modes</li></ul>        <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2237460/extras/e5ad9cd185cfb185f518c1e40973024c.avif?t=1743523927\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\">        <li>Punch enemies</li>        <li>Boss Battles</li>        <li>3 Buttons</li>        <li>Unlockable characters</li>        <li>Unlockable locations</li>        <li>Achievements</li>        <li>Steam Cloud Saves</li>        <li>Full mod support</li>        <li>Steam Workshop Support</li>        <li>Dying</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 GAME MODES</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\">        <li>Last Stance (3 buttons)</li>        <li>Classic (2 buttons)</li>        <li>Game Journalist (1 button)</li></ul>",
